author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "A bare pm activity applies a documented default bound (row limit or time window) and never returns the entire history stream by default; The envelope names the applied bound and reports what was withheld, so limit:null can no longer mean both no-limit-requested and no-limit-exists; Exceeding the declared ceiling triggers the shared degradation ladder rather than unbounded emission; An explicit unbounded request remains available and must be asked for by name; A regression test measures bare pm activity against a workspace large enough to exceed the ceiling and fails on unbounded output"
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: 95
